cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or reference this registry, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "BotShelf Vampire AI Team Registry"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "BotShelf Vampire"
abstract: >-
  An open registry and evidence format for AI Team implementations. It records
  the job performed, runtime and implementation details, verification state,
  human approval boundaries, visible failed or unexecuted evaluations, known
  limitations, and produced artifacts. Marketplace listings and Build Library
  implementations are kept distinct.
repository-code: "https://github.com/BotShelfVampire/botshelf-ai-team-registry"
url: "https://botshelfvampire.com/"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - AI agents
  - AI teams
  - agent evaluation
  - implementation evidence
  - human approval
  - runtime
  - verification
